{"seq":3,"slug":"maintenance-evolution-strategy","title":"维护与演进策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/toolsmith-mindset/open-source-your-tools/maintenance-evolution-strategy","wordCount":1431,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"维护与演进策略\">维护与演进策略</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>开源项目最大的挑战不是第一次发布，而是发布之后的持续维护。统计数据显示，GitHub 上超过 80% 的开源项目在两年内进入&quot;无人维护&quot;状态。维护不只是修 bug——它是版本管理、向后兼容承诺、依赖更新、社区管理、以及在有限精力下做出正确取舍的综合能力。本文帮助你建立一个可持续的维护模式，让你的开源项目健康地长期演进。</p>\n<p>curl 项目维护了近 30 年，至今仍活跃发布。它的维护策略值得学习：严格的向后兼容、规律的发布节奏（每 8 周一个版本）、清晰的弃用流程、以及一个不断壮大的维护者团队。不是每个项目都需要达到 curl 的规模，但它展示了可持续维护的核心原则。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><h3 id=\"语义化版本管理-semver\">语义化版本管理（Semver）</h3><p>语义化版本是开源项目与用户之间的契约：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH&#10;  │      │     └── 修复 bug，不改变 API&#10;  │      └──────── 添加新功能，向后兼容&#10;  └─────────────── 破坏性变更，可能不兼容\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>MAJOR.MINOR.PATCH</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │      │     └── 修复 bug，不改变 API</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  │      └──────── 添加新功能，向后兼容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  └─────────────── 破坏性变更，可能不兼容</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>关键承诺</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>同一个 MAJOR 版本内，升级不应该破坏现有代码</li>\n<li>MINOR 版本只添加功能，不移除或修改现有功能</li>\n<li>如果必须做破坏性变更，升 MAJOR 版本并提供迁移指南</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>0.x 阶段的特殊规则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>0.x 表示&quot;尚未稳定，API 可能随时变化&quot;</li>\n<li>此时任何版本升级都可能是破坏性的</li>\n<li>一旦有外部用户依赖你的项目，尽快发布 1.0.0</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"breaking-change-处理\">Breaking Change 处理</h3><p>破坏性变更是维护中最敏感的操作。处理流程：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;Need Breaking Change&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;Deprecation Warning&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;Wait 2+ Minor Versions&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;Migration Guide&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;Bump Major Version&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[&quot;Support Previous Major 6 months&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"Need Breaking Change\"] --&gt; B[\"Deprecation Warning\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"Wait 2+ Minor Versions\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"Migration Guide\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"Bump Major Version\"]\n    E --&gt; F[\"Support Previous Major 6 months\"]</pre><p><strong>弃用三步走</strong>：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>标记弃用</strong>：添加运行时警告，但功能仍然可用</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"function oldMethod() {&#10;  console.warn(&#39;Deprecated: oldMethod() will be removed in v3.0. Use newMethod() instead.&#39;);&#10;  return newMethod();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> oldMethod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  console.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">warn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'Deprecated: oldMethod() will be removed in v3.0. Use newMethod() instead.'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> newMethod</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><ol start=\"2\">\n<li><strong>提供替代</strong>：在同一版本中提供新 API</li>\n<li><strong>移除</strong>：在下一个 MAJOR 版本中删除旧 API</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"发布节奏设计\">发布节奏设计</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目规模</th>\n<th>推荐节奏</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>个人小工具</td>\n<td>按需发布</td>\n<td>功能完成就发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>活跃团队项目</td>\n<td>每 2 周</td>\n<td>保持节奏感</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>广泛使用的库</td>\n<td>每 4-8 周</td>\n<td>给用户适应时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基础设施工具</td>\n<td>每 8-12 周</td>\n<td>稳定性优先</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>Time-based vs. Feature-based</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Time-based（固定周期发布）：curl、Rust（6 周）、Node.js</li>\n<li>Feature-based（功能完成就发布）：大多数小项目</li>\n</ul>\n<p>建议：从 feature-based 开始，当用户基数增大后切换到 time-based，给用户可预测的升级节奏。</p>\n<h3 id=\"依赖管理策略\">依赖管理策略</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;Dependencies&quot;] --&gt; B{&quot;Security Update?&quot;}&#10;    B --&gt;|Yes| C[&quot;Patch Immediately&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|No| D{&quot;Major Update?&quot;}&#10;    D --&gt;|Yes| E[&quot;Test, Schedule for Next Major&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt;|No| F[&quot;Batch Monthly&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"Dependencies\"] --&gt; B{\"Security Update?\"}\n    B --&gt;|Yes| C[\"Patch Immediately\"]\n    B --&gt;|No| D{\"Major Update?\"}\n    D --&gt;|Yes| E[\"Test, Schedule for Next Major\"]\n    D --&gt;|No| F[\"Batch Monthly\"]</pre><p><strong>原则</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>安全漏洞：立即修补并发 patch 版本</li>\n<li>依赖的 patch/minor 更新：批量每月处理</li>\n<li>依赖的 major 更新：在你的下一个 major 版本中处理</li>\n<li>使用 Dependabot/Renovate 自动化依赖 PR</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"实战指南\">实战指南</h2><h3 id=\"建立-changelog-习惯\">建立 CHANGELOG 习惯</h3><p>每次 PR 合并时同步更新 CHANGELOG：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"# Changelog&#10;&#10;## [Unreleased]&#10;&#10;### Added&#10;&#10;- `--json-lines` output format for streaming (#142)&#10;&#10;### Changed&#10;&#10;- Default timeout increased from 5s to 30s (#138)&#10;&#10;### Fixed&#10;&#10;- Crash when config file contains Unicode BOM (#145)&#10;&#10;### Deprecated&#10;&#10;- `--format csv` — use `--format tsv` instead (removal in v3.0)&#10;&#10;## [2.3.0] - 2026-04-15&#10;&#10;### Added&#10;&#10;- Shell completion for Fish (#130) ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># Changelog</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">Unreleased</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Added</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> `--json-lines`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> output format for streaming (#142)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Changed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Default timeout increased from 5s to 30s (#138)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Fixed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Crash when config file contains Unicode BOM (#145)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Deprecated</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> `--format csv`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> — use </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`--format tsv`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> instead (removal in v3.0)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-light-text-decoration:underline;--shiki-dark:#DBEDFF;--shiki-dark-text-decoration:underline\">2.3.0</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">] - 2026-04-15</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### Added</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Shell completion for Fish (#130) ...</span></span></code></pre></div><p>工具推荐：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>conventional-changelog</strong> — 从 Conventional Commits 自动生成</li>\n<li><strong>git-cliff</strong> — Rust 实现的 CHANGELOG 生成器</li>\n<li><strong>changesets</strong> — monorepo 友好的版本管理</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"设计迁移指南\">设计迁移指南</h3><p>当发布破坏性变更时，必须提供详细的迁移指南：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"markdown\" data-code=\"# Migrating from v2 to v3&#10;&#10;## Breaking Changes&#10;&#10;### 1. `--format csv` removed&#10;&#10;**Before**: `tool export --format csv` **After**: `tool export --format tsv` **Why**: CSV 格式在存在逗号的数据中不可靠。TSV 更安全。 **Auto-fix**: `sed &#39;s/--format csv/--format tsv/g&#39; your-script.sh`&#10;&#10;### 2. Config file location changed&#10;&#10;**Before**: `~/.toolrc` **After**: `~/.config/tool/config.toml` **Why**: 遵循 XDG Base Directory 规范。 **Migration**: `mkdir -p ~/.config/tool &amp;&amp; mv ~/.toolrc ~/.config/tool/config.toml`&#10;&#10;### 3. Minimum Node.js version bumped to 18&#10;&#10;**Before**: Node 14+ **After**: Node 18+ **Why**: 使用了 Node 18 的原生 fetch API。\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"># Migrating from v2 to v3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">## Breaking Changes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 1. </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">`--format csv`</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> removed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**Before**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`tool export --format csv`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **After**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`tool export --format tsv`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **Why**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: CSV 格式在存在逗号的数据中不可靠。TSV 更安全。 </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**Auto-fix**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`sed 's/--format csv/--format tsv/g' your-script.sh`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 2. Config file location changed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**Before**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`~/.toolrc`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **After**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`~/.config/tool/config.toml`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\"> **Why**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: 遵循 XDG Base Directory 规范。 </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**Migration**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">`mkdir -p ~/.config/tool &#x26;&#x26; mv ~/.toolrc ~/.config/tool/config.toml`</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">### 3. Minimum Node.js version bumped to 18</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**Before**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: Node 14+ </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**After**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: Node 18+ </span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-light-font-weight:bold;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8;--shiki-dark-font-weight:bold\">**Why**</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: 使用了 Node 18 的原生 fetch API。</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"长期支持-lts-策略\">长期支持（LTS）策略</h3><p>对于有大量用户的项目，考虑维护多个版本：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分支</th>\n<th>状态</th>\n<th>维护内容</th>\n<th>维护期限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>main (v3)</td>\n<td>Active</td>\n<td>新功能 + bug fixes</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>v2.x</td>\n<td>Maintenance</td>\n<td>仅 bug fixes 和安全更新</td>\n<td>发布 v3 后 6 个月</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>v1.x</td>\n<td>End of Life</td>\n<td>仅关键安全更新</td>\n<td>发布 v2 后已结束</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>小项目（&lt;1000 stars）通常不需要 LTS——只维护最新版本即可。</p>\n<h3 id=\"处理-burnout\">处理 Burnout</h3><p>维护者 burnout 是开源社区最大的隐性风险：</p>\n<p><strong>预防策略</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>设定每周投入上限并严格遵守</li>\n<li>将 &quot;Won&#39;t Fix&quot; 作为合理选项——不是所有 Issue 都需要解决</li>\n<li>授权信任的贡献者为 co-maintainer</li>\n<li>公开 &quot;Maintenance Mode&quot; 状态——社区会理解</li>\n<li>对超出范围的需求说不</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>当你想要退出时</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>寻找接班人（最活跃的贡献者）</li>\n<li>将项目移交到组织名下（而非个人名下）</li>\n<li>发布 &quot;Looking for Maintainers&quot; 公告</li>\n<li>如果无人接手，标记为 &quot;Archived&quot; 而非悄然消失</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><h3 id=\"自动化一切可自动化的\">自动化一切可自动化的</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"# 自动标记过期 Issue&#10;# .github/workflows/stale.yml&#10;name: Stale&#10;on:&#10;  schedule:&#10;    - cron: &#39;0 0 * * *&#39;&#10;jobs:&#10;  stale:&#10;    runs-on: ubuntu-latest&#10;    steps:&#10;      - uses: actions/stale@v9&#10;        with:&#10;          days-before-stale: 60&#10;          days-before-close: 14&#10;          stale-issue-message: &gt;&#10;            This issue has been inactive for 60 days. &#10;            It will be closed in 14 days unless there is new activity.\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 自动标记过期 Issue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># .github/workflows/stale.yml</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Stale</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  schedule</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">cron</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'0 0 * * *'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">jobs</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  stale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    runs-on</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ubuntu-latest</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    steps</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/stale@v9</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          days-before-stale</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">60</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          days-before-close</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          stale-issue-message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            This issue has been inactive for 60 days. </span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">            It will be closed in 14 days unless there is new activity.</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"保持小规模依赖\">保持小规模依赖</h3><p>依赖越少，维护越轻松：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>优先使用语言标准库</li>\n<li>避免引入只用了一个函数的大型库</li>\n<li>定期审视依赖树（<code>npm ls --all | wc -l</code>）</li>\n<li>考虑是否需要这个依赖，还是 100 行代码就能替代</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"文档与代码同步\">文档与代码同步</h3><p>每次功能变更同步更新文档的技巧：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PR 模板中添加 &quot;Documentation Updated?&quot; 检查项</li>\n<li>CI 中检查 README 中的示例是否可执行（doctest 模式）</li>\n<li>使用 README 中的代码块作为集成测试输入</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"工具与生态\">工具与生态</h2><h3 id=\"维护者工具箱\">维护者工具箱</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Renovate / Dependabot</td>\n<td>依赖自动更新</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Changesets / Release Please</td>\n<td>版本管理和 CHANGELOG</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stale Bot</td>\n<td>过期 Issue 自动管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CodeQL</td>\n<td>安全漏洞扫描</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Codecov</td>\n<td>代码覆盖率追踪</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"长期维护案例\">长期维护案例</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目</th>\n<th>维护年限</th>\n<th>关键策略</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>curl</td>\n<td>28+ 年</td>\n<td>严格向后兼容、8 周发布周期、广泛测试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SQLite</td>\n<td>24+ 年</td>\n<td>无依赖、aviation-grade 测试（100% 分支覆盖）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Linux kernel</td>\n<td>33+ 年</td>\n<td>子系统 maintainer 分权、LTS 分支</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>React</td>\n<td>11+ 年</td>\n<td>自动 codemod、详细迁移指南、gradual adoption</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"总结\">总结</h2><p>可持续的维护是开源项目长期成功的基础。它不是靠&quot;燃烧激情&quot;维持的——而是靠系统、自动化和合理的边界。</p>\n<p>维护策略的核心原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Semver 即承诺</strong>：认真对待版本号，它是与用户的契约</li>\n<li><strong>弃用有过程</strong>：先警告、再提供替代、最后才移除</li>\n<li><strong>发布有节奏</strong>：建立可预测的发布频率</li>\n<li><strong>依赖要精简</strong>：少依赖 = 少维护</li>\n<li><strong>自动化一切</strong>：Stale bot、Dependabot、自动发布</li>\n<li><strong>保护自己</strong>：设定边界、分权、该放手时放手</li>\n<li><strong>透明沟通</strong>：项目状态、维护能力、未来方向——让社区知晓</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"维护与演进策略","id":"维护与演进策略"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"语义化版本管理（Semver）","id":"语义化版本管理-semver"},{"level":3,"text":"Breaking Change 处理","id":"breaking-change-处理"},{"level":3,"text":"发布节奏设计","id":"发布节奏设计"},{"level":3,"text":"依赖管理策略","id":"依赖管理策略"},{"level":2,"text":"实战指南","id":"实战指南"},{"level":3,"text":"建立 CHANGELOG 习惯","id":"建立-changelog-习惯"},{"level":3,"text":"设计迁移指南","id":"设计迁移指南"},{"level":3,"text":"长期支持（LTS）策略","id":"长期支持-lts-策略"},{"level":3,"text":"处理 Burnout","id":"处理-burnout"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"自动化一切可自动化的","id":"自动化一切可自动化的"},{"level":3,"text":"保持小规模依赖","id":"保持小规模依赖"},{"level":3,"text":"文档与代码同步","id":"文档与代码同步"},{"level":2,"text":"工具与生态","id":"工具与生态"},{"level":3,"text":"维护者工具箱","id":"维护者工具箱"},{"level":3,"text":"长期维护案例","id":"长期维护案例"},{"level":2,"text":"总结","id":"总结"}],"prev":{"title":"社区建设","url":"/l-doc-books/h/personal-systems/toolsmith-mindset/open-source-your-tools/community-building"},"next":null}